+e1: say 'e1' condition('O')~code condition('O')~message
+signal on syntax name e2
+.zz~define('Q', m)
+e2: say 'e2' condition('O')~code condition('O')~message
+signal on syntax name e3
+say .hm~new~try(m)
+e3: say 'e3' condition('O')~code condition('O')~message
