+x = .kt~new('x'); say 'kt x' x~items
+d = .kd~new('q'); say d~class~id d~items
+a = .set~new(5); a~put(3); say a~items .bag~new(0)~items .relation~new('3')~items .identitytable~new(7)~items
+signal on syntax name e1
